   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>&nbsp;You are developing a food delivery order queue system for a cloud kitchen. Orders must be processed in the order they are received. The volume of orders can vary widely throughout the day. </b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>You are asked to:</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify; margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Recommend a suitable implementation (array or linked list)</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify; margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Justify your choice</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify; margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Write pseudocode or C code snippets for enqueue and dequeue</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Explain how your solution handles overflow and underflow</b></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
